      "patch": "@@ -16,3 +16,10 @@\n # planting a fresh hex value in EITHER field of the tracked .example template fails the gate.\n be646fcff58052a77e848914a79ccef2279cf78f:nix/midnight-env/test-wallets/preview-test-wallet.json:umbradb-wallet-seed-hex:4\n be646fcff58052a77e848914a79ccef2279cf78f:nix/midnight-env/test-wallets/preview-test-wallet.json:umbradb-wallet-seed-hex:5\n+\n+# Verified historical graph false positive, not a credential: the generic rule crosses the\n+# quoted nodes delimiter in a serialized hyperedge and captures another declared graph node ID.\n+# Both IDs exist in graph.json at this commit, sourced from l7-precedent.md;\n+# the rationale node cites B3.\n+# This exempts ONLY this immutable finding; new content on the path remains scanned.\n+c80329a40c0c5809940fee75c793d61088aa7250:docs/research/sqlite-migration/graph/graph.html:generic-api-key:281"
    },
    {
      "sha": "acf727b1f1b73f02e5228ee66f90a4d95ec88df1",
      "filename": "docs/integrations/audits/midnight-express-recovery/adversarial.md",
      "status": "modified",
